{"seq":24,"slug":"mobile-accessibility","title":"移动端无障碍工程","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility","rating":{"composite":4.2,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"移动端无障碍工程-简介\">移动端无障碍工程 简介</h1><p>无障碍（Accessibility）工程是让所有用户——包括视觉、听觉、运动和认知障碍群体——平等使用移动应用的系统性技术实践。全球超过 13 亿人存在某种形式的残障，移动端作为数字服务的首要入口，无障碍已从「加分项」变为法律强制与商业必需：2026 年美国 ADA Title II 首次明确要求政府移动应用符合 WCAG 2.1 Level AA，欧盟无障碍法案同期生效，iOS 26 与 Android 16 均将 AI 驱动的辅助技术推向新高度。</p>\n<p><strong>适用读者</strong>：具备 3 年以上 iOS 或 Android 开发经验，熟悉平台 UI 框架（UIKit/SwiftUI/Jetpack Compose），希望系统掌握无障碍工程方法论、在产品中落地可量化的无障碍能力的移动端工程师与技术负责人。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：本 hub 专注无障碍的工程实现与验证，不覆盖通用 UI 设计模式（见 mobile-performance hub 的渲染优化）、安全与隐私（见 mobile-security hub）、跨平台框架基础用法（见 cross-platform-development hub）。本 hub 会在具体实现层引用各平台 API，但不重复这些 hub 的基础知识。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：了解 iOS UIKit/SwiftUI 或 Android View/Compose 的基本视图层级机制；理解事件分发与手势响应链；有阅读官方 HIG/Material Design 文档的经验。</p>\n<p>本 hub 包含四章内容：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>无障碍基础与平台框架</strong>，解析无障碍树的语义模型、VoiceOver 与 TalkBack 的运行机理，以及 WCAG 2.2 等标准规范在移动端的适用方式。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>交互模式与适配</strong>，覆盖触控目标与手势替代方案、动态字体响应式文本系统、颜色对比度与视觉适配的工程策略。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>工程实现</strong>，分别深入 iOS 无障碍 API、Android 无障碍 API 以及跨平台框架的无障碍桥接方案。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>测试与自动化</strong>，讲解无障碍测试工具链、系统化审计方法论以及度量监控体系的建设路径。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：按章节顺序逐步学习效果最佳——先建立语义模型与标准认知，再掌握交互适配原则，接着在具体平台落地实现，最后通过自动化测试闭环质量保障。有平台偏好的读者可在第三章选择性阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"无障碍基础与平台框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"accessibility-tree-semantics","title":"无障碍树与语义模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/foundations/accessibility-tree-semantics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"voiceover-talkback-mechanics","title":"VoiceOver 与 TalkBack 运行机理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/foundations/voiceover-talkback-mechanics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-guidelines-standards","title":"无障碍标准规范体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/foundations/accessibility-guidelines-standards"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"interaction-patterns","title":"交互模式与适配","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"touch-target-gestures","title":"触控目标与手势适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns/touch-target-gestures"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamic-type-responsive-text","title":"动态字体与响应式文本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns/dynamic-type-responsive-text"},{"seq":3,"slug":"color-contrast-visual-adaptation","title":"颜色对比度与视觉适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/interaction-patterns/color-contrast-visual-adaptation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"工程实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ios-accessibility-api","title":"iOS 无障碍 API 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/implementation/ios-accessibility-api"},{"seq":2,"slug":"android-accessibility-api","title":"Android 无障碍 API 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/implementation/android-accessibility-api"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-platform-accessibility","title":"跨平台无障碍方案","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/implementation/cross-platform-accessibility"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"testing-automation","title":"测试与自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/testing-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"accessibility-testing-tools","title":"无障碍测试工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/testing-automation/accessibility-testing-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"accessibility-audit-methodology","title":"无障碍审计方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/testing-automation/accessibility-audit-methodology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accessibility-metrics-monitoring","title":"无障碍度量与监控体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-accessibility/testing-automation/accessibility-metrics-monitoring"}]}]}